@startuml
title TheDarkOfDarkness - Tower Level (Planned)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction

rectangle "Tower Stairwell\nitems: TBD" as stairwell
rectangle "Tower Chamber\nNPC: Werewolf\ndefeat requirement: Loaded Gun\ndrop: Dark Mysterious obscure Key" as chamber
rectangle "Tower Balcony\nitems: TBD" as balcony
rectangle "Loaded Gun\ncrafted action: gun + silver bullets\nusable anywhere once crafted" as loadedGun
rectangle "Death: Werewolf\nThe werewolf pounces before you can react.\nAs it lunges: 'If only I had silver bullets...'\nThe End.\nRestart available." as death

stairwell --> chamber : up
chamber --> balcony : out
balcony --> chamber : back / return
chamber --> stairwell : leave / exit
loadedGun --> chamber : use to defeat werewolf
chamber --> death : enter without Loaded Gun

note bottom of chamber
This level is requested for mapping but is not
implemented in TheDarkOfDarkness code yet.
end note

@enduml
